3. BUNDLED FONTS — SIL Open Font Licence 1.1
-------------------------------------------------------------------

The font files in assets/fonts/ are third-party works, licensed by
their creators under the SIL Open Font Licence, Version 1.1. They are
covered by neither section 1 nor section 2 above.

    Plus Jakarta Sans     Copyright (c) Tokotype
    DM Sans               Copyright (c) Colophon Foundry,
                          Jonny Pinhorn, Indian Type Foundry
    Be Vietnam Pro        Copyright (c) Be Team

Full licence text: https://openfontlicense.org

Note that the OFL permits use, study, modification and redistribution,
but prohibits selling the font files on their own, and requires that
Reserved Font Names not be used on modified versions. The copies in
assets/fonts/ are subsets — reduced in character coverage, unchanged in
design — which the OFL permits.


